y has a record from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 165% of normal in January to February but 71% in March to April. So far in 2026, the middle sits at 56% in March to April and 62% in February to March. Grid 20292 had its driest year in 2007 at 67%.</p>"}
